1844+ 79F9 CB 3F            srl  a
1845+ 79FB CB 3F            srl  a
1846+ 79FD CB 3F            srl  a
1847+ 79FF CB 3F            srl  a                  ; Sposta i 4 bit superiori in quelli inferiori (GGGG)
1848+ 7A01 32 B6 F6         ld   (room_gravity_preset), a
